source.text:
The function $f \colon \Nat \to \Nat$ defined by:
\[
  f(x) =
  \begin{cases}
    \frac{x}{2} & \text{if $x$ is even} \\
    \frac{x+1}{2} & \text{if $x$ is odd.}
  \end{cases}
\]
is !!{surjective}, but not !!{injective}.
\end{ex}

